  "title": "do-irp: Prevent UB",
  "description": "call_data_dissector does not throw an exception if bytes are missing\nunlike some other functions, so check if they exist.\n\nA better solution for other reasons too would be to take a subset\ntvbuffer using the body length, especially since we now can handle\n32-bit unsigned lengths.\n\nOSS-Fuzz 470722045",
